---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { site } from '../data/content';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy — TenTo100"
  description="How TenTo100 collects, uses, and protects your information, including SMS opt-in and consent data."
>
  <Header />
  <main id="main" class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-5 py-16">
    <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="mt-1 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-faint">Effective date: [EFFECTIVE DATE — e.g. July 1, 2026]</p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-muted">
      This policy describes how [LEGAL ENTITY — e.g. TenTo100, LLC] (“TenTo100”, “we”, “us”)
      collects and uses information through www.tento100.com and our text-messaging (SMS)
      program.
    </p>

    <section class="mt-10">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Information we collect</h2>
      <ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 text-muted">
        <li>
          <strong>Information you give us</strong> — your name, email address, and anything you
          include when you contact us.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>SMS program information</strong> — if you opt in to text messages: your mobile
          number, the messages you send us, and your consent record (the exact consent language,
          the timestamp, and the channel on which you agreed).
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p class="mt-3 text-muted">
        We do not collect information from anyone we know to be under 13, and our services are
        not directed at children.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-10">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">How we use it</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-muted">
        To respond to you, provide our services, send the text messages you opted into, keep the
        consent records that messaging regulations require, and improve the site. We do not sell
        your personal information.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-10">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">SMS / text messaging</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-muted">
        <strong>Mobile information and SMS opt-in/consent data will not be shared with third
        parties or affiliates for marketing or promotional purposes.</strong> All other
        categories above exclude this information; it is used solely to deliver the messages you
        signed up for and to honor your opt-out.
      </p>
      <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 text-muted">
        <li><strong>Message frequency varies.</strong></li>
        <li><strong>Message and data rates may apply.</strong></li>
        <li>Reply <strong>STOP</strong> at any time to opt out; reply <strong>HELP</strong> for help.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="mt-3 text-muted">
        Messages are delivered through our messaging provider (Twilio), which processes your
        number solely to deliver them. How the program works is described at
        <a class="text-accent underline" href="/messaging">tento100.com/messaging</a>, and the
        program terms are in our
        <a class="text-accent underline" href="/terms">Terms of Service</a>.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-10">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Sharing</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-muted">
        We share information only with service providers who process it on our behalf (hosting,
        email, and message delivery), when the law requires it, or in a business transfer —
        never with third parties or affiliates for their own marketing, and never your mobile
        information or SMS consent data for marketing or promotional purposes, as stated above.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-10">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Retention &amp; your choices</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-muted">
        We keep information only as long as needed for the purposes above; SMS consent and
        opt-out records are retained as messaging regulations require. You can opt out of texts
        at any time by replying STOP, and you can ask us to access or delete your information by
        emailing <a class="text-accent underline" href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-10">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Changes &amp; contact</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-muted">
        If we change this policy we'll update this page and the effective date. Questions:
        <a class="text-accent underline" href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
